                        "glosses": [
                            "An occurrence of putting or sinking under water or other fluid."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f98365d-82ce-3a5c-8945-3fc53f7d24a3",
                        "entry_id": "e8b49d1a-f328-36fa-acfd-c3f8fe576aa9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A headlong violent motion like that of a horse trying to throw its rider."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c904ef7-8be6-4815-b63a-71e1e634dab8",
                                "sense_id": "1f98365d-82ce-3a5c-8945-3fc53f7d24a3",
                                "text": "Like one who after a night of drunken revelry hies to his bed, still reeling, but with conscience yet pricking him, as the plungings of the Roman race-horse but so much the more strike his steel tags into him; […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd46af60-363d-46ba-8584-f1ca7aded3c6",
                                "sense_id": "1f98365d-82ce-3a5c-8945-3fc53f7d24a3",
                                "text": "Then followed a confusion of kicks, cuffs, tramplings and plungings, accompanied by a thunderous intermingling of volleyed curses, and finally a bitter apostrophe to the mule, which must have broken its spirit, for hostilities seemed to cease from that moment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2133fa7-903b-4a18-8852-cb502c28326e",
                                "sense_id": "1f98365d-82ce-3a5c-8945-3fc53f7d24a3",
                                "text": "It pulled up with a mighty plunging of horses at the overturned chaise."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
